{title: Baage Vich Aaya Karo}
{artist: Suryaveer}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Meri hun vich [C]tu dis [G]da,        [G]Meri hun vich [C]tu dis [G]da
[D]Jithe jithe chale maa [C]hi,        Jee [D]kare othe othe bich [G]ja
[D]Jithe jithe chale maa [C]hi,        Jee [D]kare othe othe bich [G]ja
[G]Baage vich [C]aaya [G]karo,        [G]Baage vich [C]aaya [G]karo
[D]Ishq je kitta [C]ae,        Zara [D]milya milaya [G]karo
[D]Ishq je kitta [C]ae,        Zara [D]milya milaya [G]karo
[G]Tusi yaad mainu [C]aan?de [G]ho,        [G]Tusi yaad mainu [C]aan?de [G]ho
[D]Jee mera naiyo [C]lagda,        Haaye [D]bada hi sataan?de [G]ho
[D]Jee mera naiyo [C]lagda,        Haaye [D]bada hi sataan?de [G]ho
Tere [C]bina ni lag [D]da,        Tere [G]bina dil ni lagda
Tere [C]bina ni lag [D]da,        Tere [G]bina dil ni lag [D]da
Aise [G]rishte nu [C]pyar kahi [G]ye,        Aise [G]rishte nu [C]pyar kahi [G]ye
[D]Asa vi diwane [C]haan,        Jad [D]kaho jaan waar [G]daiye
[D]Asa vi diwane [C]haan,        Jad [D]kaho jaan waar [G]daiye
[G]Tusi jitto te [C]Mai hari jaa [G]wan,        [G]Tusi jitto te [C]Mai hari jaa [G]wan
[D]Ishq de khel de [C]vich,        Main [D]lakh lakh wari ja [G]waan
[D]Ishq de khel de [C]vich,        Main [D]lakh lakh wari ja [G]waan
Tere [C]bina ni lag [D]da,        Tere [G]bina dil ni lagda
